        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"f9dd82ed-59e7-441e-b999-41863d09dc1f\",\"review_text\":\"This app support cyberbullying to female artist .\"},{\"review_id\":\"23d1899e-8b05-4926-b650-dd1342ff3052\",\"review_text\":\"I haven't yet used this app in over a year, however if it's the same or better. I'm Happy wit that, 🕶️🤙\"},{\"review_id\":\"d82a9ea2-6af8-48d4-92a6-6aaab8f703e4\",\"review_text\":\"Itachi uchiha\"},{\"review_id\":\"bd003e26-6296-4605-9695-293e7a795222\",\"review_text\":\"I love Spotify.. But after the recent updates, the app has been either crashing, not loading or freezing. It's not everyday but at least 4 times a week and it's starting to pss me off. My phone is up to date and so are all other apps..\"},{\"review_id\":\"bda2682c-a8c5-476f-aba0-d5b0df1fcb03\",\"review_text\":\"Best music listening song quality 👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"6678d67e-81f8-412d-89f4-0da0ba807806\",\"review_text\":\"The canvas option is not in setting?\"},{\"review_id\":\"a2453186-a5e6-40e1-9917-c9057dc915c9\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify used to be really good but now they've taken pretty much everything from their free feature\"},{\"review_id\":\"7c1ca82d-eb5f-4f44-9a58-ae9246521bdb\",\"review_text\":\"The new update is terrible. Highly disappointed, Didn't knew Spotify would scoop this low just for money\"},{\"review_id\":\"8ec3a997-8c00-40ed-8353-3554366e9aef\",\"review_text\":\"Bruh this requires premium to scroll to portions of a song lmao\"},{\"review_id\":\"475d6d0e-10aa-4847-a8b1-b5673155130f\",\"review_text\":\"Just easy to music i like\"}]}"
